<title>VENEZUELA: Enron's Ventane year loss 327 mln bolivars.</title>
<headline>Enron's Ventane year loss 327 mln bolivars.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			   1995</p>
<p>    Net loss	 326.6 million bolivars	profit 6.906 bln</p>
<p>    Sales	     26.971 bln bolivars	    22.471 bln</p>
<p>    Cost of sales   10.108 bln bolivars	     2.293 bln</p>
<p>    Operating costs 10.324 bln bolivars	     9.166 bln</p>
<p>NOTES: All results are expressed in constant December 31, 1996, bolivars.</p>
<p>Industrias Ventane SA is Venezuela's leading liquid gas company and is 80 percent owned by Enron Corp.</p>
<p>((--Caracas Newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
